{"text":"<span><br />https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6-WlTWTG5c<br /><br />### 1-55. Kusalattika-sārammaṇadukaṃ ^7-53-0 </span><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53a-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15793.034122\">4:23:13</span> 1. Kusalaṃ sārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-53a-1 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15804.020675\">4:23:24</span> Akusalaṃ sārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15812.674931\">4:23:32</span> Abyākataṃ sārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)\nḥ</span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15822.143763\">4:23:42</span> 2. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-53a-2 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15832.567258\">4:23:52</span> 3. Kusalo sārammaṇo dhammo kusalassa sārammaṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-53a-3 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15843.591301\">4:24:03</span> Akusalo sārammaṇo dhammo akusalassa sārammaṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15851.133262\">4:24:11</span> Abyākato sārammaṇo dhammo abyākatassa sārammaṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15860.344859\">4:24:20</span> Kusalo sārammaṇo dhammo kusalassa sārammaṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15868.697943\">4:24:28</span> 4. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53a-4\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetusahajātapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15880.617201\">4:24:40</span> 5. Abyākataṃ anārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53a-5 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15890.658003\">4:24:50</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetuyā ekaṃ…pe… (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15902.444099\">4:25:02</span> 6. Abyākato anārammaṇo dhammo abyākatassa anārammaṇassa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo… aññamaññapaccayena paccayo… nissayapaccayena paccayo… āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo… atthipaccayena paccayo… avigatapaccayena paccayo (sabbattha ekaṃ. Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-53a-6 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-56. Kusalattika-cittadukaṃ ^7-53b-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15932.455552\">4:25:32</span> 7. Kusalo citto dhammo kusalassa cittassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53b-7 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15942.457873\">4:25:42</span> Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15957.368746\">4:25:57</span> 8. Kusalaṃ nocittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-53b-8 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15966.650896\">4:26:06</span> Akusalaṃ nocittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15975.505595\">4:26:15</span> Abyākataṃ nocittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15984.689855\">4:26:24</span> Kusalaṃ nocittañca abyākataṃ nocittañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15996.19586\">4:26:36</span> Akusalaṃ nocittañca abyākataṃ nocittañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16006.711684\">4:26:46</span> Kusalaṃ nocittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nocitto dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16015.710241\">4:26:55</span> 9. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-53b-9</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16028.049221\">4:27:08</span> 10. Kusalo nocitto dhammo kusalassa nocittassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53b-10 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16035.933129\">4:27:15</span> Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-57. Kusalattika-cetasikadukaṃ ^7-53c-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53d-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16042.137922\">4:27:22</span> 11. Kusalaṃ cetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo cetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-53d-11 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16053.030461\">4:27:33</span> Akusalaṃ cetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo cetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16061.386529\">4:27:41</span> Abyākataṃ cetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato cetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16070.173705\">4:27:50</span> 12. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-53d-12 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16077.988992\">4:27:57</span><span> 13. Kusalo cetasiko dhammo kusalassa cetasikassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-53d-13 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16085.748098\">4:28:05</span><span> Akusalo cetasiko dhammo akusalassa cetasikassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16094.016128\">4:28:14</span><span> Abyākato cetasiko dhammo abyākatassa cetasikassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16102.085428\">4:28:22</span><span> Kusalo cetasiko dhammo kusalassa cetasikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16111.534762\">4:28:31</span><span> Akusalo cetasiko dhammo akusalassa cetasikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16120.676152\">4:28:40</span><span> Abyākato cetasiko dhammo abyākatassa cetasikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16130.10325\">4:28:50</span><span> 14. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53d-14\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16142.221323\">4:29:02</span><span> 15. Kusalaṃ acetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-53d-15 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16154.83949\">4:29:14</span><span> Akusalaṃ acetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n\nAbyākataṃ acetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n\nKusalaṃ acetasikañca abyākataṃ acetasikañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n\nAkusalaṃ acetasikañca abyākataṃ acetasikañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16154.834319\">4:29:14</span><span> 16. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca. ^7-53d-16</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16159.928177\">4:29:19</span><span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe pañca, novigate pañca.\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-58-65. Kusalattika-cittasampayuttādidukāni ^7-53e-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53f-0 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16168.834536\">4:29:28</span><span> 17. Kusalaṃ cittasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… kusalaṃ cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivatti dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53f-17 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16209.166317\">4:30:09</span><span> Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi pañhāvārampi evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-66. Kusalattika-ajjhattikadukaṃ ^7-53g-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53h-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16222.257862\">4:30:22</span><span> 18. Abyākataṃ ajjhattikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato ajjhattiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53h-18 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16232.083361\">4:30:32</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16242.819722\">4:30:42</span><span> 19. Kusalo ajjhattiko dhammo kusalassa ajjhattikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo ajjhattiko dhammo akusalassa ajjhattikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo ajjhattiko dhammo abyākatassa ajjhattikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-53h-19 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16269.729485\">4:31:09</span><span> Akusalo ajjhattiko dhammo akusalassa ajjhattikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16279.412715\">4:31:19</span><span> Abyākato ajjhattiko dhammo abyākatassa ajjhattikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16289.730349\">4:31:29</span><span> 20. Ārammaṇe nava, purejāte tīṇi…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-53h-20 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16300.984738\">4:31:40</span><span> 21. Kusalaṃ bāhiraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo bāhiro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53h-21 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16313.455971\">4:31:53</span><span> Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… vipāke ekaṃ…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16323.933759\">4:32:03</span> 22. Kusalo bāhiro dhammo kusalassa bāhirassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53h-22 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16331.797709\">4:32:11</span> Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-67. Kusalattika-upādādukaṃ ^7-53i-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53j-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16343.854023\">4:32:23</span> 23. Abyākato upādā dhammo abyākatassa upādā dhammassa āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo… atthipaccayena paccayo… avigatapaccayena paccayo. ^7-53j-23\n<br />Āhāre ekaṃ, indriye atthiyā avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16363.683466\">4:32:43</span> 24. Kusalaṃ noupādā dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo noupādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-53j-24 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16374.065387\">4:32:54</span> Akusalaṃ noupādā dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo noupādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16383.389298\">4:33:03</span> Abyākataṃ noupādā dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noupādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n<br />Kusalaṃ noupādā ca abyākataṃ noupādā ca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noupādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n<br />Akusalaṃ noupādā ca abyākataṃ noupādā ca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noupādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16397.499348\">4:33:17</span> 25. Hetuyā nava… (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-53j-25 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16403.482538\">4:33:23</span> 26. Kusalo noupādā dhammo kusalassa noupādā dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-53j-26 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16412.742047\">4:33:32</span> Akusalo noupādā dhammo akusalassa noupādā dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16421.871725\">4:33:41</span> Abyākato noupādā dhammo abyākatassa noupādā dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16431.111451\">4:33:51</span> 27. Kusalo noupādā dhammo kusalassa noupādā dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-53j-27 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16439.987802\">4:33:59</span> Akusalo noupādā dhammo akusalassa noupādā dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16449.781963\">4:34:09</span> Abyākato noupādā dhammo abyākatassa noupādā dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16460.976399\">4:34:20</span> 28. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa…pe… avigate ekādasa (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53j-28\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-68. Kusalattika-upādinnadukaṃ ^7-53k-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-53l-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16473.425247\">4:34:33</span> 29. Abyākataṃ upādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato upādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-53l-29 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16486.043744\">4:34:46</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16496.629431\">4:34:56</span> 30. Kusalaṃ anupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-53l-30 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16505.843582\">4:35:05</span> Akusalaṃ anupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16515.986627\">4:35:15</span> Abyākataṃ anupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n<br />Kusalaṃ anupādinnañca abyākataṃ anupādinnañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)\n\nAkusalaṃ anupādinnañca abyākataṃ anupādinnañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16525.929253\">4:35:25</span> 31. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-53l-31 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16536.328938\">4:35:36</span> 32. Kusalo anupādinno dhammo kusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-53l-32 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16545.200987\">4:35:45</span> Akusalo anupādinno dhammo akusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16554.181531\">4:35:54</span> Abyākato anupādinno dhammo abyākatassa anupādinnassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16563.998646\">4:36:03</span> 33. Kusalo anupādinno dhammo kusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-53l-33 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16572.976062\">4:36:12</span> Akusalo anupādinno dhammo akusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16582.544657\">4:36:22</span> Abyākato anupādinno dhammo abyākatassa anupādinnassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato anupādinno dhammo kusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato anupādinno dhammo akusalassa anupādinnassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16602.343253\">4:36:42</span> 34. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa, anantare cha…pe… sahajāte nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava…pe… avigate ekādasa (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53l-34\n\nKusalattikamahantaradukaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### 1-69-74. Kusalattika-upādānādidukāni </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16615.572489\">4:36:55</span> 35. Akusalaṃ upādānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo upādāno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-53l-35 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"16627.600373\">4:37:07</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (upādānagocchakaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ).\n\nKusalattikaupādānagocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.\n</span></p>","media-time":16627.600373}